 "summary": "No existing declaration in Mathlib, TauCeti, Physlib or EpsilonEridani is duplicated: there is no group under power-series substitution upstream (only `substInvOfIsUnit` and its cancellation lemmas, which this PR reuses), Mathlib's substitution coefficients exist only in `finsum` form (`coeff_subst'`), and no in-repo file touches `PowerSeries` apart from the three new ones. New material builds on `subst_comp_subst_apply`, `derivative_subst`, `rescale_eq_subst`, `coeff_X_pow_mul` and the `MulAction` API rather than re-deriving them.",
